## Plan of execution (при начале TZ-230)

**Tick 1:** Sub-task D (TS errors cleanup) → unblock backend CI → разблокирует Tick 2.
**Tick 2:** Sub-task F (frontend any-cleanup) → unblock frontend CI → разблокирует Tick 3.
**Tick 3:** Sub-task B (password verification) + Sub-task H.1 (TZ-127 rate-limit) → security wins.
**Tick 4:** Sub-task A (audit-log unification) + Sub-task G (data integrity).
**Tick 5:** Sub-task C (design tokens) → Sub-task E (apply design system) → final visual QA pass.

**Co-review gates:** После каждого tick — `pnpm tsc --noEmit` (frontend + backend) + `pnpm test`. Plus `bash OrchestratorKit/verify-status.sh` должен вернуть EXIT=0 перед close.

